  <item>
    <title>消失的朋友圈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b7566acace72dff8419f83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b7566acace72dff8419f83</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 07:40:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这里是歪鹅古德 · 第四期。依然无人问津的我们~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期其实是连着“30岁”那期一起录的，但由于中间壹鹅突然飞到了泉州去浪，所以迟迟没有剪出来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结果就是，连着泉州的那一期，壹鹅开始爆肝剪辑，爆肝上传了~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 选题的由来，被动或主动的让朋友圈“消失”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 朋友圈中一些“遥远”的声音或信息，影响到真实的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> 大部分人的朋友圈，都是工作属性大于生活属性&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 从朋友圈被定义，被“贴标签”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 主动或被动的在朋友圈“表演”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 朋友圈也是需求的一种表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 朋友圈也是维系人与人之间链接的一种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 朋友圈的消失是“评论”的消失，只剩下“赞”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 关于在朋友圈送出的“祝福”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 朋友圈的“置顶”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 朋友圈的“分类”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 由朋友圈，体悟到的“友情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3708">61:48</a> 朋友圈的“筛选价值观”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4686">78:06</a> 浅谈朋友圈的“爱情”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期观点仅为主播自己感受。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎大家有一样或者不一样的想法在评论区友好谈论~</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv2YWJhNmIrY0gOULfgQyTovAqvN.m4a" length="88111621" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:48</itunes:duration>
